WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:26.080 --> 00:00:32.040
You know, there is something about a tangle of strangers, pressed together for days with nothing in common...

00:00:32.040 --> 00:00:36.900
...but the need to go from one place to another and never see each other again.

00:00:46.440 --> 00:00:48.440
I see evil on this train.

00:00:53.660 --> 00:00:55.160
A passenger has died.

00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:02.400
So they got him after all.

00:01:02.620 --> 00:01:04.740
You assume he was killed.

00:01:04.740 --> 00:01:06.420
No, no. No.

00:01:08.940 --> 00:01:12.180
Well, he was in perfectly good health. He had his enemies.

00:01:12.180 --> 00:01:14.180
Indeed. He was murdered.

00:01:14.440 --> 00:01:16.520
Good God. A murder, here.

00:01:17.560 --> 00:01:19.320
God rest his soul.

00:01:19.780 --> 00:01:23.720
Someone was rummaging around my cabin in the middle of the night. No one would listen to me.

00:01:24.080 --> 00:01:25.240
If there was a murder...

00:01:25.360 --> 00:01:26.840
What is going on?

00:01:27.040 --> 00:01:27.780
...then there was a murderer.

00:01:28.100 --> 00:01:32.900
The murderer is with us and every one of you is a suspect.

00:01:34.520 --> 00:01:35.780
And who are you?

00:01:38.200 --> 00:01:41.800
My name is Hercule Poirot and I am probably the greatest detective in the world.

